Greetings S,

New dock house - July 5 photographs were more of the dock box and floating dock; can see some of the house
on the end of the dock - my photos of the other dock house are very very old, but I can forward them if you wish

Pool cabana - photos from July 2012

Five Palms - photos from June 28, 29, and July 5, 2012

Tiki Hut - JE was on site when the panels were installed, so I never took photos.

Let me know if you are interested in the REALLY early shots, DW

On Fri, Jan 18, 2013 at 11:26 AM,                                         > wrote:
 Hi Daphne! I was wondering if you might have some nice photos of the following areas on the island you
 could send me;
 The new dock house, the inside of the pool cabana, 5 Palms outside and inside and the tiki nut with the panels
 on the ceiling
 Anything you have of these that would be nice to print would be great. thanks!




