 Good Evening
     As requested attached a briefbreakdown with photos ofitems to be reviewed. I reached out to the 71st team
for any updates on progress, as ofdate & time I have not received a response, hence some items may have been
 completed
     As already mentioned the areas which require the most work are the Mech Storage Bays, noting there has
 been a great deal ofprogress in the Sub Cellar over the lastfews weeks
     Carlos & Arline have a good understanding of what needs to be completed & have a great work ethic,
 so ho e ull things can start moving along.
